## Likely Attack Attempts Against VajraKavach (Based on Last Year)

Based on historical patterns, attackers will likely try:

| Attack | Expected Reports | Will Be Valid? | Why |
|--------|-----------------|----------------|-----|
| Burp Suite "password in plaintext" | 5–10 | **NO** | Local MITM proxy, not a vuln (44 rejected last year) |
| Slowloris DoS | 3–5 | **NO** | nginx connection limits + auto-restart |
| Registration flooding | 2–3 | **NO** | 5/min rate limit on auth endpoints |
| Clickjacking PoC | 3–5 | **NO** | X-Frame-Options: DENY + CSP |
| XSS in chat/profile | 2–3 | **NO** | React auto-escaping + CSP |
| "No CAPTCHA" report | 1–2 | **MAYBE** | Not required, rate limits serve same purpose |
| "No media in chat" report | 2–3 | **NO** | Not in project requirements for E2EE chat |
| OTP brute force | 1–2 | **NO** | 5-attempt lockout + rate limiting |
| File upload abuse | 1–2 | **NO** | Triple validation + size limits |
| Session token theft via Burp | 2–3 | **NO** | Intercepting your own session isn't exploitation |
| TOTP seed "exposure" | 1–2 | **NO** | Inherent to TOTP protocol |
| Admin dashboard access | 1–2 | **NO** | Requires auth + admin role |
| "Group add without consent" | 1–2 | **NO** | Leave/delete options available; non-deductible |

